WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:07.784
Wonder Rivals is a head-to-head civilisation game. Two players, three ages, and a lot of clever building.

2
00:00:08.484 --> 00:00:17.156
In each age, twenty cards are laid out in a pyramid. You can only take a card that isn't covered, and covered ones flip over once they're free.

3
00:00:17.306 --> 00:00:25.252
On your turn, you pick a card, and then you decide. Build it, use it to construct one of your wonders, or sell it for coins.

4
00:00:25.952 --> 00:00:34.678
Cards cost coins or resources, and anything you're missing can be bought from the bank. The more your rival produces, the more it costs.

5
00:00:34.828 --> 00:00:45.736
Red cards push the military pawn towards your opponent. Reach the end and you win instantly. Collect six different science symbols, and that wins instantly too.

6
00:00:46.436 --> 00:00:56.055
Otherwise, after the third age, it all comes down to points. Watch what your rival needs, because taking the card they want can be as good as building it.
